VIII. 17. 2 Tim. II. 11. &amp; III. 12. Jao. I. 12. 1 Petr. IV.</hi></note> <foreign xml:lang="heb"><gap reason="fm" unit="words"/></foreign> <hi rendition="#aq">Kli</hi> heißt<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Hauß-</fw><lb/>
